      "reference": "SexAndPreg:82",
      "reference_highlight": "Anal",
      "local_notes": "Receptive accommodation; no Stimulation itself. Max Erotic Art. Apply source size/anatomy modifiers and failure/injury rules.\n\nSeptember reference: Defaults EA-1; HT-3; Holdout-3; prerequisites EA; maximum **EA+0** as printed; Stimulation None itself. Receptive accommodation roll. -2/level Large Penis or Tight Anus; failure makes subsequent failed sexual techniques drop an Arousal Level; critical failure can cause ½ partner thrust injury + equal FP. Once accommodated, use a normal position for Stimulation. Female recipients take -2 Stimulation or the lower variable value.\n\nAlternative default entry: choose one default for this technique, not several separate purchases. Where the named maximum depends on a different skill or the lower of two skills, enforce that cross-skill maximum manually; GCS limit is relative to the selected default.",
