    {
      "id": "q8SvMtMJ0Azf1hmc_",
      "name": "Auto-Cunnilingus",
      "reference": "Sol:17",
      "reference_highlight": "Auto-Cunnilingus",
      "local_notes": "**Defaults:** Oral-5, Erotic Art-6, or IQ-10  \n**Prerequisite:** Flexibility +5 **or** anatomy/morphology that makes self-cunnilingus physically possible  \n**Maximum:** Oral  \n**Stimulation:** **5(3)**\n\nThe character performs cunnilingus on herself. Treat this as the self-use version of Oral applied to the vagina.\n\nThe generic **+3 for performing a technique on yourself does not stack**; self-use is already built into the technique's default.\n\nA GM may apply physiological modifiers or waive the Flexibility requirement for nonhuman anatomy such as a sufficiently long neck or prehensile tongue.\n\nGCS use: choose one default variant for a purchased technique. A maximum tied to another skill, or the lower of two skills, must be checked against the named skill(s); the native limit field is relative to the selected default. Apply situational modifiers to the roll, not as bonuses to all Erotic Art techniques.",
      "tags": [
        "Sexual"
      ],
      "difficulty": "a",
