    {
      "id": "qEqhr9V2U7uTz4hgN",
      "name": "Auto-Fellatio (Deep Throat)",
      "reference": "Sol:11",
      "reference_highlight": "Auto-Fellatio (Deep Throat)",
      "local_notes": "**Defaults:** Deep Throat-5, Auto-Fellatio (Oral)-2, Oral-7, or Erotic Art-10  \n**Prerequisites:** Oral 12+; Large Penis; Flexibility +5 or equivalent morphology  \n**Maximum:** Oral  \n**Stimulation:** **6**, plus any applicable Sexual Feature bonus inherited from Deep Throat\n\nThis is the self-directed Deep Throat version. It represents suppressing the gag reflex and managing depth while also maintaining the extreme posture required for Auto-Fellatio.\n\n**Modifiers:** Apply the normal Deep Throat **-2 per level of Large Penis**. The generic +3 self-use modifier does not stack.\n\n**Failure:** Lose **1 FP from suffocation**, as with Deep Throat.  \n**Critical failure:** Apply the normal critical-failure loss of an Arousal Level in addition to any ordinary Deep Throat consequences the GM considers appropriate.\n\nFor a stricter progression, the GM may also require **Auto-Fellatio (Oral) 12+** before this technique can be improved.\n\nGCS use: choose one default variant for a purchased technique. A maximum tied to another skill, or the lower of two skills, must be checked against the named skill(s); the native limit field is relative to the selected default. Apply situational modifiers to the roll, not as bonuses to all Erotic Art techniques.",
