      "name": "Auto-Fellatio (Oral)",
      "reference": "Sol:11",
      "reference_highlight": "Auto-Fellatio (Oral)",
      "local_notes": "**Defaults:** Oral-5, Erotic Art-6, or IQ-10  \n**Prerequisites:** Large Penis; Flexibility +5 or anatomy/morphology that makes full self-fellatio possible  \n**Maximum:** Oral  \n**Stimulation:** **5(3)**\n\nThis is the purchasable self-use version of Oral hinted at by the source rules. The performer must be capable of full self-fellatio rather than merely reaching the tip.\n\nThe normal **+3 for performing a technique on yourself does not stack** with this technique; the difficulty of self-use is already built into the Auto-Fellatio default. Other Oral modifiers, such as Breath Control where appropriate, still apply.\n\nA GM may reduce or waive the Flexibility requirement for nonhuman anatomy that naturally makes the reach possible.\n\nGCS use: choose one default variant for a purchased technique. A maximum tied to another skill, or the lower of two skills, must be checked against the named skill(s); the native limit field is relative to the selected default. Apply situational modifiers to the roll, not as bonuses to all Erotic Art techniques.",
