      "id": "q9aUYnqCjreyJn_4q",
      "name": "Cervical Accommodation",
      "reference": "Sol:13",
      "reference_highlight": "Cervical Accommodation",
      "local_notes": "**Defaults:** Stuffing-4 or Erotic Art-7  \n**Prerequisites:** Stuffing 12+; appropriate receptive anatomy  \n**Maximum:** Stuffing  \n**Stimulation:** None\n\nThis is an advanced extension of Stuffing used to deliberately accommodate unusually deep penetration without treating increased depth as permanent anatomical change.\n\n**Success:** Increase effective penetration depth by **50%** for the current use.  \n**Greater accommodation:** Take an additional **-4** to increase effective depth by **100%** instead.  \n**Failure:** No additional accommodation is gained.  \n**Critical failure:** Treat this as a critical failure of Stuffing for injury purposes, or substitute an anatomically appropriate strain/injury if that better fits the scene.\n\n**Optional Sol Mahina fertility rule:** If ejaculation occurs while Cervical Accommodation is successfully maintained, apply **+2 to the conception roll**. This is a setting rule, not a claim about real-world fertility.\n\nGCS use: choose one default variant for a purchased technique. A maximum tied to another skill, or the lower of two skills, must be checked against the named skill(s); the native limit field is relative to the selected default. Apply situational modifiers to the roll, not as bonuses to all Erotic Art techniques.",
