    {
      "id": "qpGuZdHV6-TYY8quQ",
      "name": "Deep Auto-Knotting",
      "reference": "Sol:18",
      "reference_highlight": "Deep Auto-Knotting",
      "local_notes": "**Defaults:** Auto-Knotting-2, or \\[lower of Auto-Fellatio (Deep Throat) and Knot-Tying]-4  \n**Prerequisites:** Auto-Knotting 12+, Auto-Fellatio (Deep Throat) 12+, Large Penis 1+, Exotic Genitalia, and Breath Control 12+ **or** Doesn't Breathe  \n**Maximum:** Lower of Auto-Fellatio (Deep Throat) or Knot-Tying  \n**Stimulation:** **10(4)**\n\nThis is the deep-throat version of Auto-Knotting. The locking anatomy is deliberately taken deeply enough that the lock engages in or against the throat rather than merely within the mouth. The character is simultaneously controlling penetration, receiving it, suppressing the gag reflex, positioning the lock, and managing the airway.\n\n**Modifiers:** Apply the normal Deep Throat **-2 per level of Large Penis**.\n\n**Success:** 10 Stimulation.  \n**Ordinary failure:** 4 Stimulation and lose **1 FP from suffocation**.  \n**Critical failure:** Lose **1d FP immediately**, make the usual Mating-Lock Management or Stuffing roll for bad alignment, and apply the normal critical-failure loss of an Arousal Level.\n\nIf the character becomes physically locked while unable to breathe, use the normal GURPS suffocation rules until the lock releases, the character frees themselves, or they lose consciousness.\n\nA character with **Doesn't Breathe** ignores suffocation and airway FP loss, but not bad alignment, injury, or the normal sexual-technique critical-failure effects.\n\nThe generic +3 self-use modifier does not stack with Deep Auto-Knotting.\n\nGCS use: choose one default variant for a purchased technique. A maximum tied to another skill, or the lower of two skills, must be checked against the named skill(s); the native limit field is relative to the selected default. Apply situational modifiers to the roll, not as bonuses to all Erotic Art techniques.",
