      "reference": "Sol:14",
      "reference_highlight": "Deep Guidance",
      "local_notes": "**Default:** Erotic Art-5  \n**Prerequisites:** Erotic Art 14+ and Trained by a Master (Erotic)  \n**Maximum:** Erotic Art  \n**Stimulation:** None\n\nDeep Guidance represents exceptionally precise active-partner control of angle, timing, depth, and movement to help a receptive partner manage difficult anatomy.\n\nUse it to assist **Stuffing, Cervical Accommodation, or Mating-Lock Management** when positioning is the limiting factor.\n\nThe modifier to the recipient's accommodation roll is:\n\n- **Critical success:** +4\n- **Success:** +1, plus another +1 per full 5 points of margin of success, to a maximum of +4 total\n- **Failure:** -1\n- **Critical failure:** -2\n\nDeep Guidance does not itself provide Stimulation. It modifies the recipient's relevant accommodation roll.\n\nGCS use: choose one default variant for a purchased technique. A maximum tied to another skill, or the lower of two skills, must be checked against the named skill(s); the native limit field is relative to the selected default. Apply situational modifiers to the roll, not as bonuses to all Erotic Art techniques.",
