      "local_notes": "Specialize by other position. Add +2 Stimulation to the base technique; only the partner on top can attempt it. See source for FP/injury and ST modifiers. Other penetration position -5 (manually set specialization)\n\nSeptember reference: Defaults Other position-5; EA-5 implies Missionary; prerequisites —; maximum —; Stimulation **+2 to base**. Forceful add-on usable with penetration positions by the partner on top. Failure costs 1d FP; critical failure inflicts 1 injury on target. +1 ST12+, +2 ST16+, or GM may make it ST-based.\n\nAlternative default entry: choose one default for this technique, not several separate purchases. Where the named maximum depends on a different skill or the lower of two skills, enforce that cross-skill maximum manually; GCS limit is relative to the selected default.\n\nGCS selection required: replace @Other Position Technique@ with the exact name of the applicable learned technique. For a lower-of rule, select the lower current level and recheck after either technique changes.\n\nDefault selection: choose the applicable other position technique at −5. The notes do not restrict this default to vaginal positions. The Erotic Art−5 variant represents the Missionary basis.",
