    {
      "id": "qpCQ6iHSBTuRNUe1R",
      "name": "Scissoring",
      "reference": "Sol:12",
      "reference_highlight": "Scissoring",
      "local_notes": "**Defaults:** Erotic Art-2, Grind, or Masturbation (Female)-2  \n**Prerequisite:** Erotic Art  \n**Maximum:** Erotic Art  \n**Stimulation:** **4(2)** to each participant as a primary technique\n\nScissoring is mutual genital rubbing between two partners. When used as the primary sexual technique, each participant normally receives **4(2)** Stimulation.\n\n**Adjunct use:** Scissoring may instead be incorporated into another suitable technique. In that case, do not use the normal 4(2) value; a successful Scissoring roll adds **+2 Stimulation** to each participant actually receiving direct genital contact.\n\n**Modifiers:** +1 for DX 12+, or +2 for DX 16+.\n\nA critical success doubles the Stimulation generated by Scissoring itself. When used as an adjunct, that means **+4 instead of +2**; it does not double the underlying technique unless that technique also critically succeeds.\n\nGCS use: choose one default variant for a purchased technique. A maximum tied to another skill, or the lower of two skills, must be checked against the named skill(s); the native limit field is relative to the selected default. Apply situational modifiers to the roll, not as bonuses to all Erotic Art techniques.",
